==== Serial ====
-> [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial]] general information about the serial port, serial port cable, etc.

How to connect to the serial port of this specific device:
  - Remove radiator and SoC shield.
  - Short two pads labeled R87:\\ {{:media:tplink:archerc2600:c2600_serial_resistor.png?200}}
  - Pinout: Blue - 1v8 Tx, Green - 1v8 Rx, Yellow - Vcc 1v8, Red - Vcc 3v3, Orange - GND\\ {{media:tplink:archerc2600:c2600_serial_tx_rx.png?200}}
  - Use "Bi-Directional Logic Level Shifter Converter" to get 3v3 logic:\\ {{media:tplink:archerc2600:c2600_serial_level_shifter.png?200| Now: 3v3 Tx - HV4, 3v3 Rx - HV3, GND - GND}}

^ Serial connection parameters\\ for TP-Link Archer C2600 v1 | 115200, 8N1 |

